NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the prose, tables and scripts in this repository only.

It does not and cannot cover the Qurʾānic text, any muṣḥaf layout, line-break
or glyph dataset, or any typeface. This repository ships none of those — it
tells you where to obtain them and how to verify them. Every such resource
carries its own terms, held by its own rights holder, and clearing them is
your responsibility. See references/licensing.md, and read it before you
bundle anything.
